Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?Readable=20log:=20one=20=E6=B6=88=E9=9F=B3=20li?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ne=20per=20muted=20word=20with=20source,=20[=E8=AF=AD=E9=9F=B3?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E6=B6=88=E9=9F=B3]=20prefix,=20recent-mutes=20list?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Hit line: "消音 来源=<source> 词=<word>[（同音：<pinyin>）]", plus 原文="..." only while
  debug logging is on. The "(extended by stream)" and "[ASR Debug] stream muted" lines are gone.
- Debug recognition lines: "识别 来源=… 时间=…" at sentence end, "识别中 …" at most every 2 s of
  audio (counted from the sentence start), instead of one line per partial.
- Prefix [Profanity Filter] / [Speech Sync] -> [语音消音]; model load line simplified.
- censor::RecordHit/RecentHits/ClearHits/HitSerial: last 100 mutes in memory.
- Settings: 屏蔽词 > 最近消音 [查看…] opens a list (time, source, word, sentence) with 清空.
- Log tooltip describes the new lines.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
